    "reviewedOn": "2026-11-18",
    "notes": "Started with the three published Qualla CC0-labelled families. Both local digital originals are nearby gates beyond the main temple and the 2011 image is a transfer with no independently inspected original English Wikipedia record. The same local photographer’s four direct, contemporaneous CC0 exterior uploads provide the hilltop temple’s geometry and color. Every file’s EXIF DateTimeOriginal and GPS date say 20 February 2024 despite the batch title saying 2023."
